  "notes": [
    "The Confederation of the Rhine list's maximums and minimums are per every 1,000 points unless otherwise stated (p. 172). The builder applies them as written, which is right for armies up to 1,000 points; scale them up yourself for larger armies.",
    "Line infantry cost 37 points in the stat table (p. 171) but 36 in the Infantry Brigade box (p. 173); the builder uses the stat table.",
    "The book gives no stat line for a half Light battery: the downgrade takes 8 points off but leaves its stats as they are."
  ],
