  "specialRules": [
    "Bavarian infantry follow the French infantry special rules.",
    "Lacking Initiative (Line infantry): can't make initiative moves except to change formation or facing, or to charge the nearest enemy to their front.",
    "Bavarian cavalry can use Deep Formation and Cavalry Mixed Formation.",
    "Rheinbund infantry follow the French infantry special rules without Pas de Charge, and are Lacking Initiative. They get no +1 for shooting at short range, suffer -1 at medium and long range, and get no bonus for being skirmishers when shooting."
  ],
